0..54 Comment "//! `moved-to-closer` sends a file handle to a closer."
55..58 Comment "//!"
59..135 Comment "//! The send consumes the mover\'s linear handle. The closer owns the handle."
136..201 Comment "//! The move twins refuse a repeated move or a post-move close as"
202..223 Comment "//! `UsedAfterClose`."
224..227 Comment "//!"
228..281 Comment "//! The trace tests settle the send and close events."
282..329 Comment "//! The source imports `File` from `file-base`."
330..333 Comment "//!"
334..397 Comment "//! After a C++ move, the object remains valid but unspecified."
398..427 Comment "//! No move constructor runs."
428..478 Comment "//! Rust moves a non-`Copy` value at `let b = a;`."
479..533 Comment "//! - see: `lib.types.movedfrom` in ISO/IEC 14882:2020"
534..582 Comment "//! - see: file-base.gandr — the file protocol"
